# AGENT CAPSULE

Bash hooks + local `NOW.md`. One model per conversation.
Read `NOW.md` when sessionStart points at it. Prefer NO CODE. Smallest Diff. Zero prose comments.
Git only when asked. Secrets never in code or chat. Security: `SECURITY.md`.
Done = cited proof, green. Never fight a deny.
Never reintroduce Rust kleos-gate or pack Python.

## Harness (five registered events)

| Event | Script | Job |
|---|---|---|
| sessionStart | `session_start.sh` | `additional_context`: path to NOW.md. Quiet in plan mode. |
| beforeSubmitPrompt | `before_submit_prompt.sh` | Secret/token in prompt → `continue: false`. Else `continue: true`. |
| beforeShellExecution | `before_shell.sh` | Destructive / source-write deny. Secret path in command deny. Complexity-lint disable deny. Infra/DB `ask`. |
| beforeReadFile | `before_read_file.sh` | Secret paths deny (`failClosed: true`). |
| stop | `stop.sh` | Ponytail diff gate: unrequested rewrite (>50% lines, file ≥80 LOC) or mass reindent. One `followup_message`, `loop_limit: 1`, else `{}`. |

This pack registers the five above. No `postToolUse`, `preToolUse`, or `beforeMCPExecution`. Writes are not blocked at write time; `stop` cannot refuse completion.

Brain = `NOW.md`. Local install only (`~/.cursor`). Skills on demand. Hooks never inject `.mdc`. No `updated_input`. Review: `hunter`, `cut`, `prove`.
Open the files you will change. One or two sentences: outcome, files, proof.
